00:11:51.000 --> 00:12:24.000
I talked about problems with sleep. If you don't sleep, you don't do well in the day. But because nights were oftentimes where trauma occurred or they have nightmares, they're terrified of sleep. and they're hyper aroused. Their nervous system is jacked up because of all the trauma and the flashbacks and the nightmares. And so helping them get their sleep regulated, helping them get any self-harm or suicidal thoughts under control, helping them learn not to dissociate so much their what's called losing time.
我谈到了睡眠问题。如果你睡不好，白天就无法正常工作。但因为夜晚往往是创伤发生的时候，或者他们有噩梦，他们害怕睡觉。他们处于过度觉醒状态。由于所有的创伤、闪回和噩梦，他们的神经系统处于高度紧张状态。因此，帮助他们调节睡眠，帮助他们控制自残或自杀念头，帮助他们学会不要过度解离——也就是所谓的“失去时间”。

