00:12:24.000 --> 00:13:06.000
They're having those gaps in memory. So you're basically doing a lot of teaching tools that help the person manage their symptoms, function day to day. And also another thing is addressing profound shame, self-hatred, and taking it out on themselves, basically. That's through the self-harm, for example. And so you do a lot to try and educate them about the impact of trauma. So they don't feel like they're just, you know, this evil, awful person, but they understand the things they're struggling with are symptoms. Anyway, all of that is stage one, stabilization and safety. if they get stable, and there are some folks that that's the stage they stay at.
他们会出现记忆空白。所以你基本上是在做大量的教学工具，帮助个人管理症状，进行日常运作。另一个方面是解决深层的羞耻感、自我厌恶，以及基本上对自己进行伤害。例如，通过自残。所以你要做很多工作来尝试教育他们创伤的影响。这样他们就不会觉得自己是一个邪恶、糟糕的人，而是明白他们所挣扎的事情是症状。总之，所有这些都是第一阶段：稳定和安全。如果他们稳定下来，有些人会停留在这一阶段。

